		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4709&amp;p=34910#p34910"><![CDATA[
After select the donor file ( GD-77_V4.3.6.sgl ) you have to select the openGD77 firmware<br><br>The latest firmware <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/3ed4d3301fb6fb8c539d17a10ee36c6026206b9a/OpenGD77.zip" class="postlink">downloads/GD77/Firmware/3ed4d3301fb6fb8 ... enGD77.zip</a><br><br>Before click on the openGD77 firmware by click on “select a file and update”. Make sure your radio is connected to the computer. Press and hold PTT and the button right below it while turning it on. Then select the firmware. Now you should see the flashing begin. <br><br>Hope this helps,<br>Charlie,<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5068">KA1CM</a> — Wed Dec 25, 2024 3:15 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
